# The Darksmith (bastok 40): Mighty Fist in the Metalworks. The guard (Bastok fame level 3), the offer 565, then the
# second section (accepted and completed): 561 until its finish sets the quest's mustZone, 560 after it, the two
# Chunks of Darksteel Ore trade (566), which completes the quest again each time. Mighty Fist has his own script (561
# until its finish sets the local var spokenMetalFist, 560 after), and the lookup alternates the quest's Event-priority
# action with that script. DRK AF1 (Dark Legacy) also names him, and this char (a WAR) never meets its guard.
lists Metalworks/Mighty_Fist/onTrigger Metalworks/Mighty_Fist/onTrade Metalworks/onEventFinish/565 Metalworks/onEventFinish/561 Metalworks/onEventFinish/566
char zone=Metalworks pos=-45.2,2.777,-31.2
fame Bastok 124
item ChunkOfDarksteelOre x5
item BoneChip
login
trade Mighty_Fist ChunkOfDarksteelOre x2  # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Mighty_Fist             # fame 124 (level 2): his script, 561
finish                          # his script: spokenMetalFist 1
trigger Mighty_Fist             # his script, 560
finish
fame Bastok 125
trigger Mighty_Fist             # fame level 3: the offer, 565
finish                          # accepted
trigger Mighty_Fist             # accepted, no mustZone: 561
finish                          # mustZone set (his script also runs: spokenMetalFist already 1)
trigger Mighty_Fist             # the lookup turns to his script (ret nil): 560
finish
trigger Mighty_Fist             # the quest again, mustZone set: 560
finish
trigger Mighty_Fist             # his script: 560
finish
zoneline BastokMarkets          # out and back: the quest's mustZone cleared
zoneline Metalworks
trigger Mighty_Fist             # the quest, mustZone clear: 561
finish                          # mustZone set again
trigger Mighty_Fist             # his script: 560 (spokenMetalFist is still 1)
finish
trade Mighty_Fist BoneChip x1   # the wrong item: nothing
trade Mighty_Fist ChunkOfDarksteelOre x1  # one ore: nothing
trade Mighty_Fist ChunkOfDarksteelOre x2  # 566
finish                          # completed: 8000 gil, fame +16, two ores gone, the quest's vars cleared
trigger Mighty_Fist             # completed: the quest, mustZone cleared by the completion: 561
finish                          # mustZone set
trigger Mighty_Fist             # his script: 560
finish
trade Mighty_Fist ChunkOfDarksteelOre x2  # completed: 566 again
finish                          # completed again: 8000 gil, fame +16
